<title>MALAYSIA: Malayan Cement year net rises 66 pct.</title>
<headline>Malayan Cement year net rises 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Nov 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     45.2	  vs	  27.2</p>
<p>    Net profit		149.61	 vs	  90.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		  652.89	 vs	 529.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  160.13	 vs	 121.72</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  nil	   vs	  21.32</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)     28.0	  vs	  21.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Malayan Cement Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
